750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled with buildup and/or debris:
A) sprayer at 3 part sink (crevice around sprayer surface with black buildup);
B) outer surfaces of bulk pecan and cashew storage containers (food debris);
C) dry storage shelves - 1. breading storage (breading/dust),  2. canned food racks (dust/buildup);
D) walkin cooler shelves (mold);
E) fry hot holding on cook line - 1. bottom storage area (food debris) & 2. pans holding fried food bags (crumbs/salt); and
F) fryers (dust/grease) - back ledge in lower compartments.

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris. Maintain them clean.
